        "notes": "Round 4 we need to decide if our team needs help with the enemy frontline not dying or if we are going to keep bullying the enemy backline. So want to pick up either  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) or  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) Depending on if you need the anti-heal or some more CC from the slow to make finishing off their back line easier.  \n\nOptional, if you are really pulling in some cash go ahead and pick up   [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and continue to play aggressive throwing Updraft bolas into the enemy backline every chance you get and just farm nonstop Ults.",
