        "notes": "Round 5 we are taking  [Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8) Combined with your constant updraft bolas and the slow from  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) it should be easy to land more Take Aim bolts and autos meaning more Updraft and more Bolas. \n\nNOTE: If you took  [Mighty Gust](item_e9309cc7-c02b-47ad-b953-37510d3d2768) in round 3 you are going to want to take  [So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) this round. If you took  [Mighty Gust](item_e9309cc7-c02b-47ad-b953-37510d3d2768) assuming you are still dealing with an aggressive enemy team or a Genji consider taking  [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) instead of  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) to give you more survivability but not hurting your DPS too much having the extra Take Aim Bolts from the extra Quick Dash charges.",
